From: wangzlei <66336933+wangzlei@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 15:16:20 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 5/8] exp: RPM ships the default eBPF config in
 etc/ebpf/obi.yaml

fetch-config (ManageAgent configure) empties amazon-cloudwatch-agent.d, so a
default OBI config placed there disappears and eBPF stops. The RPM now ships
it as etc/ebpf/obi.yaml (%config(noreplace)) and start-amazon-cloudwatch-agent
passes it as the first -otelconfig, so .d YAMLs and the translated agent YAML
override it. touch etc/ebpf/disabled turns it off.
