 .../amazon-cloudwatch-agent-ebpf.yaml         | 123 ++++++++++++++++++
 packaging/linux/amazon-cloudwatch-agent.spec  |   2 +
 5 files changed, 155 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 packaging/dependencies/amazon-cloudwatch-agent-ebpf.yaml

